  "body": "Fixed\n- Sound comes out of the USB sound card instead of the socket on the board\n  that nothing is plugged into. The phone was playing everything into a\n  speaker that does not exist.\n- The two programs a phone call needs to carry sound were missing from the\n  phone altogether. They were built but never installed, so a call could\n  never have had audio in either direction.\n",
