  "body": "Fixed\n- Downloading an update over mobile data now carries on where it stopped.\n  The phone used to throw away everything it had downloaded whenever the\n  connection dropped, so on a slow signal the download could never finish\n  however many times you tried. It now keeps what it has and asks only\n  for the rest.\n",
